# BossMind Coordinator

This repository is one of five isolated BossMind projects.

- Shared memory authority: Neon `bossmind_shared` (not Cursor chat context)
- Offline queue: PGlite (hub local-memory path)
- Coordinator hub docs (Windows): `D:\BossMind\PROJECT_COORDINATOR.md`
